": "ss2.png", "id": "421888538948247", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982542_421888542281580_7961047171456036679_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YLW-K8jf-l8Q7kNvwHu3flM&_nc_oc=AdoBhHHQqW5LQsfK2kNOJqX-d2xIgTjZNK6QYRe02retsh8ivXNS5LhJNsXx77d34v4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSR9flUmm4bqwfJ1pZ-ot_8-gEdmP0vevTRt8irKQUuNg&oe=6B05C762"}, {"file_name": "ss1.png", "id": "900672037137096", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569452_900672040470429_3602208668542724751_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wInLIxGQjjsQ7kNvwFjOcyg&_nc_oc=AdoscsjBnZpiMW51iX-5M8yXwLd63BhensGCUVTWQUA4d_E1JlRHYTPjh-Fl--02c-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRHhd5x41WUjlzCSYUrsuCWeBP6VglBWSMn5ciOUGDqIA&oe=6B05AEB6"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "215595850179052", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036702_215595853512385_1516722769013058759_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7QuLnpWA8soQ7kNvwHBR3gO&_nc_oc=AdoalXnBfbczTpED9gt5R5AQFrtgBCokwQDc2ZYjU4tte7w73P-WX7U-vPbin99rydA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRPqd5OWRPUAjXornilvOhUHziw3VirQcoXEEujgYyYng&oe=6B05B624"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "416146802772950", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982521_416146806106283_7161111592696257607_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NuK737fW9rQQ7kNvwFClCLV&_nc_oc=AdpkGYYBjQwTou_bNE4VSviFKkb3T0TCBlXiafY2oK1BA4a6qopJOxwYFD233OkbStQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQUy4UqHMQnRbVVCZ4feRiSGqtUwNf_M1SRK0LOUIJRnw&oe=6B05D3D0"}, {"file_name": "ss7.png", "id": "512472986379303", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_512472989712636_7638735751378089066_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7FZEHblVVCkQ7kNvwEnww_e&_nc_oc=AdrjiLKb3hFaENGYHIHxoY4ivIxcdjyfJlmBHasfqL8Z6MJmu0CfWVvV1nObYQzSZj8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRBsFh9WoU53y4Z27AvRBo4lfZw4KVabBUgK0qBdeNX5w&oe=6B05CE61"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Counter Fight ICHIRAN", "keywords": ["ICHIRAN", "CounterFight", "JobSimulator", "Ramen", "cooking"], "long_description": "Make some mouth-watering ramen!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game created with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan. Established over 60 years ago, it's been perfecting its hit specialty tonkotsu ramen for a long time, which is why ICHIRAN's ramen is the best in the land. In fact, it's often touted in the media as a \"must-try cuisine\" for foreign visitors.\n\nGame Features:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score! \nImmersive kitchen-based gameplay lets you experience life as a real ICHIRAN employee, racking up points for your ramen preparation skills and speedy delivery.\n\n\u30fbClimb the ranks in store management mode! \nYour score in store management mode is entered into a world ranking. Boost your profits to employ more staff and increase seating capacity as you try to hit the high scores with your own unique store!\n\n*In-game kitchen layout may differ from actual restaurants.", "short_description": "Cook some knockout noodles!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game made with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous organic tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan, often touted as a \"must-try cuisine\" for tourists. It has outlets in NY, Hong Kong, and Taiwan, too.\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score!\n\u30fbTake top place in store management mode!\n\u30fbBoost profits, employ more staff, up capacity, and hit the high scores with your own unique store!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "MiniLandscape.png", "id": "3838591046231584", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984462_3838591052898250_5002299579482394963_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-PUCWtoqPWkQ7kNvwElcOPF&_nc_oc=AdqjHvTOVrgUu2LOdX4Uir_vumTJR8GlwePpFoZjZlM_p95KmWALa-TLh58kRxtMhHg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRaaiIbjYQLBcckfejD9AI-Ot-wtrBJ-iRq_POsAqvsrg&oe=6B05B91E"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "2182671695203710", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_2182671698537043_1819436220465957851_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GIKXGk7DxVYQ7kNvwH_Mdke&_nc_oc=Adqq9kRpSwNltjUtMEl3Wwt8M0tvP6IIUuUyx3aDIjU16uRyjoxQRS7r6gorfrgAjO8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT5DOQa2RQ1TDr6tSfSIW66ozs1XGV0KU7nJtGzc8wR7g&oe=6B05CEBB"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "446502446404480", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476755_446502449737813_695504826495623275_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nyQsGD-BIqoQ7kNvwFy0cHZ&_nc_oc=AdrATFTwHlIBXjIt96lQdNmqvQBh65HEowsOROFLKW5ZqfhNGKvC0113IikTeDka7Ok&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRCnNpXU7E0Ld727aWXhgbq4GZBqqdgEPsNmp1VHGuD2w&oe=6B05BAE1"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "442920633578734", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240108_442920636912067_8939691330164956004_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6oDF9nBvZBkQ7kNvwG-uw9d&_nc_oc=AdpP2JMYfYizc-Lifiyev0HBnb55x-6h0TMkzT2zRNM596MzsnUVZQXy0Ap5yR0YJJ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQlXOfp8KZ_Xlgm4Fseo5SCCuowu1vf0a5I